ut expands SNMP_COMMUNITY, so the exact literal branch-readonly cannot be independently confirmed.","The asset register was directly verified after execution only on node1; node2's prepared copy has no post-executor integrity observation.","The provider-wide restart protocol is strong for node1 and demonstrates node2's changed boot identity and recovered end-to-end SNMP operation, but it does not directly verify node2's asset data after restart. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate both restarts."]}
